OL,3,GNEWSATeen boxer eyes up Team GB glory
OL,4,Aat Youth Olympics
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boxer from south-west London
OL,7,Fis eyeing potential future Olympic
OL,8,Fglory after she was selected by Team GB
OL,9,Fto compete in the Youth Olympics at the
OL,10,Fend of this month.
OL,12,FLily Bassett, 16, from Tooting,
OL,13,Frecently won her fourth consecutive
OL,14,Fjunior European Championship gold medal
OL,15,Fin Serbia after she beat opponents up
OL,16,Fto three years older than her.
OL,18,FShe is among 16 athletes across a range
OL,19,Fof sports who will represent Great
OL,20,FBritain at the Youth Games which begin
OL,21,Fin Dakar, Senegal, on 31 October.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
