OL,3,GNEWSATeen boxer eyes up Team GB glory
OL,4,Aat Youth Olympics
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarcus Luther, who started coaching
OL,7,FBassett at his club TM Boxing when she
OL,8,Fwas six, said she had the talent to
OL,9,Fmake it all the way to the top.
